    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Noel Kelly Auctioneers are delighted to bring No. 2 Inbhir Ide to the market. This beautifully extended three-bedroom residence with the added benefit of an attic conversion enjoys an enviable position in this highly sought-after development, offering well-proportioned accommodation and excellent potential for modern family living. Ideally located, the property is within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities, transport links and schools.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe accommodation consists of a welcoming entrance hall with bespoke under-stairs storage, a light-filled lounge featuring a beautiful open fireplace and fitted display units, a stylish open-plan kitchen / dining and family area and a guest wc / utility. Double doors leads seamlessly from the living space onto a beautifully landscaped, low-maintenance rear garden, creating an ideal setting for outdoor entertaining and relaxation. Upstairs the property continues to impress with two spacious double bedrooms both with an abundance of fitted wardrobes, one single bedroom and a large family bathroom. This property is further enhanced by a converted attic for storage or an ideal work from home space.\r\n\r\nMalahide is one of North Dublin’s most sought-after coastal villages, renowned for its picturesque surroundings, vibrant village atmosphere and excellent selection of amenities. Residents enjoy an array of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and recreational facilities with beautiful coastal walks and Malahide Castle & Gardens close by. Excellent transport links, including the DART, provide easy access to Dublin City Centre and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t      4.68 x 1.87\tDecorative timber floor, security alarm, dragon’s den understair storage\r\n \r\nLounge\t4.88 x 3.33\tDecorative timber floor, spotlights, open fireplace with marble surround, bespoke display unit, bespoke media unit\r\n\r\nKitchen     4.04 x 4.46\tTiled floor, fully fitted kitchen, subway tiled backsplash, dishwasher, fridge / freezer, belling cooker, extractor fan, hob, peninsula breakfast area with timber countertop\r\n\r\nDining / Family Room\t4.1 x 4.46\tTiled floor, 2 x velux windows, spotlights, double doors to maintenance free rear garden\r\n \t\t\r\nUtility\t\t    Plumbed for washer/dryer\r\n\r\nStairs/Landing  \t\tCarpet floor\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\t3.28 x 1.73\t  Tiled floor & partial tiled walls, wc, whb, bath suite, shower screen, feature over hanging shower head, towel rail, large hot press\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t      5.52 x 2.82\t  Abundance of fitted wardrobes, spotlights\r\n\r\nEn suite shower room\t1.77 x 0.95\tWalk in triton electric shower, holders whb, mirror \r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t3.92 x 3.41\tFitted wardrobes, overlooking green space\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t2.10 x 2.2\tFitted wardrobes, overlooking green space\r\n\r\nAttic Room\t3.02 x 3.90\tEaves storage, velux window\r\n \r\nGarden\t       No Maintenance landscaped rear garden, raised bedding, part patio, part artificial grass, timber garden shed, fully fenced"
      },
